      "notes": [
        "Two open lobes joined by a 6 x 4 neck. The neck is exactly the melee band wide, so it is a place to be caught rather than a place to fight, and the two lobes cannot be read from one another — which is the partitioned-sightline answer to fighting from a doorway.",
        "The middle region deliberately overhangs both lobes by a unit. `arenaContains` requires a body to fit inside a *single* convex region, so a passage that merely touched at the seam would be impassable at the player's radius."
      ]
